<title>FINLAND: Estonian Eesti Uhispank 9-mth profit up.</title>
<headline>Estonian Eesti Uhispank 9-mth profit up.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonian Bank Eesti Uhispank -- listed on the Helsinki brokers' list -- said in a statement on Friday its January-September pretax profit had risen to 41.6 million kroons from 35.2 million in the same period last year.</p>
<p>The bank reports results every month.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358 - 0 - 680 50 242</p>
